# Renders stay out of git. The repo-root rule (2026-09-18, Bear) already says
# final masters are OUT, but its globs only catch the *-slate / *-cut / *-review
# / *-topaz / *-8k variants. A clean master is named
# <TopicName>_AdwaitChangan_<YYYY-MM-DD>.mp4 with no suffix, so nothing upstream
# matches it and `git add` on this folder would commit a 4K file.
#
# These masters are delivered by hand to the Drive. This repo carries the source
# that rebuilds them: beat sheets, signed gates, factchecks and build prompts.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
